# Windsurf rules for sunheart-ai
# (Mirrors .cursorrules · same contract for any IDE-embedded agent)

You are contributing to Sunheart AI — open-source treasury intelligence.

Read README.md, AGENTS.md, MATHEMATICS.md, ISSUES.md before any code.

Pure functions in kernel/. No I/O. Update tests/ for every kernel change. Anchor every change to a kernel layer. Python 3.10+ stdlib only in kernel/.

Verify with:
  python -m unittest discover tests -v
  python examples/first_contribution.py

CI matrix: 3.10, 3.11, 3.12.
